{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object approached, take it, then process it. If visible, approach it. Avoid obstacles. Move to other locations. list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = MoveToNextLocation    /> <Condition ID = IsObstacleDetected    /> <Action ID = AvoidObstacle    />",
